{"slug":"how-to-modify-external-param-with-a-closure-in-php","title":"PHP中如何在匿名函数中修改外部变量","date":"2019-11-21","tags":["PHP"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"在PHP中使用闭包时，会遇到需要修改闭包外部的变量操作，这时该如何操作呢？","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1,"contentHtml":"<blockquote>\n<p>PHP中如何在匿名函数中修改外部变量</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"解决方案\">解决方案</h3>\n<p>使用<code>use</code>对外部参数声明<code>&#x26;</code>引用，示例：</p>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>$foo = 'foo';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$changeFoo = function() use (&#x26;$foo) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  $foo = 'fooo';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ehco $foo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Expected: 'fooo'</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">php</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"注意\">注意</h3>\n<p>若不使用<code>&#x26;</code>符号，则只是用一个定义一个跟<code>$foo</code>同名的局部变量来指向外部$foo的值，此时在匿名函数内部改变<code>$foo</code>的值仅仅只是改变临时变量的值，示例：</p>\n<div class=\"svp-code-block-wrapper\"><div class=\"svp-code-block\">\n    \n    <pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light night-owl\" style=\"background-color:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627;color:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>$foo = 'foo';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>$changeFoo = function() use ($foo) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  $foo = 'fooo';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ehco $foo;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Expected: 'foo'</span></span></code></pre>\n    <div class=\"svp-code-block--lang\">php</div>\n    <button class=\"svp-code-block--copy-btn\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><span class=\"svp-code-block--copy-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"svp-code-block--check-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"20 6 9 17 4 12\"></polyline></svg></span></button>\n    \n  </div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"参考\">参考</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.php.net/manual/en/functions.anonymous.php\">官方文档</a></p>","related":[{"slug":"laravel-api-ahthentication","title":"Laravel 框架学习——多表 api 认证","date":"2019-09-01","tags":["PHP","Laravel"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"Laravel提供了API认证，但是只支持一张表，如何完成多表API认证呢","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"laravel-preview","title":"Laravel框架学习 - 概览","date":"2019-08-15","tags":["PHP","Laravel"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"预览Laravel框架","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1},{"slug":"how-to-buid-vuecli3-project-to-war","title":"将Vue-cli3.0搭建的前端项目构建并打包成war文件","date":"2019-10-05","tags":["Vue","Tomcat","Java"],"category":"Server-side","excerpt":"公司新项目采用前后分离，前端Vue，后端SpringBoot，部署平台只接受war包，需求就是把前端build之后的资源打成war包","author":"Dongsheng Zhao","readingTime":1}]}